          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Musengwa yali ninze, era yampa amaani naakobera mu bwidhuvu abamaghanga agandi ekibono kya Katonda, baakiwulira. Olwo yamponia okunsalira ogw'okufa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era Musengwa oyo aidha kumponia kiisi kibi kyonakyona, antuuse bukalamu mu Bwakyabazinga bwe obw'omu igulu. Agheebwenga ekitiisa ebyanda n'ebyanda. Amiina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.18"
            ]
          }
        }
